<title>USA: Citizens Financial Group names Scott Kisting COO.</title>
<headline>Citizens Financial Group names Scott Kisting COO.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Financial Group Inc said Tuesday it had named Scott Kisting as chief operating officer, effective September 1.</p>
<p>Citizens is owned 76.5 percent by Royal Bank of Scotland Plc and 23.5 percent by Bank of Ireland.</p>
